Error [E0422]: `#Uninit` has no initializer
  --> tests/ui/uninit_has_init.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     #Uninit x: Int := 5
    |                    ^^
 Why: `#Uninit` declares a binding you fill in later; it cannot also be given a value here
 Fix: drop the initializer — write `#Uninit x: <Type>` and write to `x` before reading it
